description.narrative:
Output: The Philippines&apos; skills development ecosystem modernized Indicator: 51 new and/or updated gender-responsive and socially inclusive TOP courses developed and introduced Progress/Status: 1. First batch of TOP courses to be developed based on basic competencies of existing TRs (in-house development of TOP courseware in Nov&apos;25);
2. Post identification of CS/TR by Lead Consultants, TOP to be updated/new TOP developed as per technical competencies to accomplish target of 51 coursewares; and
3. With the reorganization at TESDA during the last quarter of 2025,e-TESDA was absorbed by ICTO. The responsibility of developing the TOP courseware will be clarified within ICTO by January 2026. Data Source: List of programs in TOP&apos;s TVET compendium Actual value:
